cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "The Human Firewall: Human Factors in Cyber Security & Privacy"
message: >-
  Please cite this lesson using the information in this file
  when you refer to it in publications, and/or if you
  re-use, adapt, or expand on the content in your own
  training material.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "ADCI"
    website: "https://adci.edu.au/"
abstract: >-
  An open companion lesson to the ADCI microcredential on human factors in
  cyber security and privacy. Twelve short episodes, written for employees of
  small organisations and the educators who teach them, cover social
  engineering, identity, insider threat, privacy law, security awareness and
  incident response.
